<title>UK: NPI Finance adds 30 million stg to perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>NPI Finance adds 30 million stg to perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and SBC</p>
<p>Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NPI FINANCE PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  (SUBORDINATED) NATIONAL PROVIDENT INSTITUTION</p>
<p> AMT    *130 MLN STG  COUPON     9.625     MATURITY    **</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  ****	PAY DATE ***09.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    ****	SPREAD	+140 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.5 PCT 2006 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY 100 MLN STERLING LAUNCHED 04.JUN.96</p>
<p>	     **UNDATED. COUPON WILL BE RESET ON 30.JUN.06 AND EACH</p>
<p>		 FIFTH ANNIVERSARY THEREAFTER AT HIGHER OF PREVIOUS</p>
<p>		 INTEREST RATE OR 240 BP OVER FIVE-YEAR GILT</p>
<p>	    ***PLUS 111 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>	   ****TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
